  "description": "Erection of an additional floor at roof level in connection with the creation of 5no. additional HMO rooms, and erection of a three storey plus basement level extension including formation of new lightwells in the rear garden in connection with the creation of 12no. additional HMO rooms to the existing large House in Multiple Occupation (HMO - Class Sui Generis); rebuilding existing chimney stack and reinstatement of chimney pots at roof level of the main building; erection of foldable guard rails around the perimeter, installation of 2no. air source heat pumps, erection of an acoustic barrier, and installation of a roof access hatch on top of the flat roof at roof level of the main building; erection of a bike and a bin store in the rear garden; excavation of part of the rear garden to enlarge existing rear lightwell; minor external alterations and associated works including landscaping.",
